**Table of Contents**

**1. Market Overview**

The construction management software market is one of the
fastest-growing verticals in enterprise SaaS. The global market reached
approximately \$11 billion in 2025 and is projected to exceed \$23
billion by 2032, driven by an industry-wide shift away from paper,
spreadsheets, and fragmented point solutions toward integrated digital
workflows.

