**4. Competitive Positioning & White Space**

**4.1 The Positioning Map**

The construction software market has a clear two-axis gap that no
current player occupies:

-   X-axis: Accessibility --- from enterprise-only (Procore, Jonas) to
    accessible to small companies (Buildertrend, eSUB)

-   Y-axis: Trade depth --- from generic project management (Procore,
    Buildertrend, Fieldwire) to trade-specific workflows (eSUB, partial)

The top-right quadrant --- accessible pricing AND deep trade-specific
workflows --- is empty. That is the \[PLATFORM NAME\] position.

